{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415345","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415345","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041534501:1":{"text":"...또 이 계절이 돌아왔군.","source_cn":"……又到了这个季节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x854E6261780900EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041534502:1":{"text":"추위와 어둠, 그리고 한순간 사라지는 얼음과 눈조차도 영원으로 변모할 것이니...","source_cn":"寒冷，黑暗，连转瞬即逝的冰雪都足以化为永恒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A9E0F13300FE329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041534503:1":{"text":"우리 그레이브본에게 어울리는 나날이지 않나?","source_cn":"这是属于我等亡灵的日子……不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x999BC04A95486721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041534504:1":{"text":"그렇습니다, 폐하. 길고도 고요한 죽음은 이 순간에만 누릴 수 있는 것이지요.","source_cn":"正是如此，陛下，这漫长与宁静的安详之死，唯有此时此刻才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB42A3F05A22B70FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041534505:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 네 뱀들은 겨울잠을 자지 않나?","source_cn":"说到这个，你的那些小宝贝们，不会冬眠吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED551D67CFCD36A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041534506:1":{"text":"이것은 마법과 피, 그리고 살로 만들어진 피조물이니 평범한 것들처럼 겨울잠을...","source_cn":"这是通过魔法与血肉凝聚的造物，当然不会如凡俗之物那般——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B182AAF6097D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041534507:1":{"text":"...폐하, 지금 농담하신 겁니까?","source_cn":"……不对，您刚刚是在开玩笑吗，陛下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7DB3E1AAE2CFED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041534508:1":{"text":"하... 나보다 유머 감각이 부족한 자는 오랜만에 보는군.","source_cn":"呵……我也是很久没有遇到比我更没有幽默感的家伙了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA70F0F2570B9F2C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041534509:1":{"text":"저를 칭찬하시는 것은 아닌 것 같습니다만, 폐하...","source_cn":"我猜，这也不是一句夸奖吧，陛下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE54C88DEDEBAFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:托安":{"text":"토란","source":"托安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维珀里安":{"text":"비페리안","source":"维珀里安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}